// The secrets device against the machine's keyring, under a service of
// its own that it forgets again: only with ENT_TEST_KEYRING=1, as it
// writes to the user's keyring (and a locked one asks to be unlocked).
// REQUIRES: keyring
// RUN: %ent build %S/Inputs/secrets_kept.ent -o %t.program
// RUN: %t.program | FileCheck %s

// CHECK:      available true
// CHECK-NEXT: kept true [s3cr3t é] other []
// CHECK-NEXT: again true [second] forgotten true []
